   "name": "South Street Historic District",
   "status": "ongoing",
   "summary": "The commission initiated preliminary reports, owner notifications, and public outreach for the proposed South Street Historic District in early 2023. After drafting reports and holding public hearings, the commission voted to support the district's creation and submitted the proposal to city bodies. Officers noted the requirement to file the district map with the Registrar of Deeds to finalize its official status. Commission activities subsequently shifted toward implementation, including conducting neighborhood walking tours and planning historic signage for the district.",
